=== A: command position ===
  ok    CATCH    A1  line start                                 
  ok    CATCH    A2  after ;                                    
  ok    CATCH    A3  after &&                                   
  ok    CATCH    A4  after ||                                   
  ok    CATCH    A5  after pipe                                 
  ok    CATCH    A6  after &                                    
  ok    CATCH    A7  subshell (                                 
  ok    CATCH    A8  group {                                    
  ok    CATCH    A9  then                                       
  ok    CATCH    A9  else                                       
  ok    CATCH    A9  elif                                       
  ok    CATCH    A9  do                                         
  ok    CATCH    A10 negation !                                 
  ok    CATCH    A12 cmd subst                                  
  ok    CATCH    A13 backtick                                   
  ok    CATCH    A15 assignment prefix                          
  ok    CATCH    A15 two assignments                            
=== A: deliberately excluded / named-uncovered ===
  ok    CLEAN    A17 case pattern (excl)                        
  ok    CLEAN    A14 time prefix (unc)                          
  ok    CLEAN    A16 redirect pfx (unc)                         
=== B: non-comment hash must survive the scanner ===
  ok    CATCH    B1  brace-hash length                          
  ok    CATCH    B2  dollar-hash argc                           
  ok    CATCH    B3  dquote hash                                
  ok    CATCH    B4  squote hash                                
  ok    CATCH    B5  escaped hash                               
  ok    CATCH    B6  mid-word hash                              
  ok    CATCH    B7  ANSI-C quote                               
=== B: real comments still removed ===
  ok    CLEAN    real trailing comment                          
  ok    CLEAN    real full-line comment                         
  ok    CLEAN    comment after ;                                
=== C: tails ===
  ok    CATCH    C1  blank + arg                                
  ok    CATCH    C2  EOL bare                                   
  ok    CATCH    C3  semicolon                                  
  ok    CATCH    C4  ampersand                                  
  ok    CATCH    C5  pipe                                       
  ok    CATCH    C6  close paren                                
  ok    CLEAN    C7  brace (excluded)                           
  ok    CLEAN    C8  definition ()                              
  ok    CLEAN    C8  definition sp ()                           
  ok    CLEAN    C9  assignment                                 
  ok    CLEAN    C10 word continuation                          
  ok    CLEAN    C10 skipping word                              
=== D: data vs code ===
  ok    CLEAN    D1  skip inside squote                         
  ok    CLEAN    D1  skip inside dquote                         
  ok    CLEAN    D2  eval string (unc)                          
